WEBVTT

00:00:04.960 --> 00:00:11.150
Every automation is also a journey: the path of waits and emails that nurtures the lead over time.

00:00:11.150 --> 00:00:15.540
In Campaigns, the lead-capture form simulates a website form.

00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:23.030
Whoever submits enters the CRM straight away as a lead, with origin Form, firing the new-customer automations.

